layout_mode = 2
size_flags_vertical = 1
text = "Tap escape - Go back/close menu
Hold escape - Pause (duh, how else did you get here?)
Left click - Interact

Click on the book to enter the FactBuilder. Clicking the \"Check\" button will highlight the FactPieces.

After checking an accurate fact, the false pieces will be removed and the book is put to the side. Then (if you aren't a messy person) you can place them on the bookshelf. You can even change the labels!

We hope you enjoy the game at least a little bit. <3"
label_settings = SubResource("LabelSettings_fob5h")
autowrap_mode = 3

